        ]),
        new("subjuntivo", "Subjuntivo", "subjunctive",
            "The mood of the subjective: wishes, requests, feelings, doubt and denial, and things not yet real. It appears after <em lang=\"es\">que</em> when the main clause expresses one of these (<em lang=\"es\">quiero que, espero que, me alegra que, no creo que, es importante que</em>), after <em lang=\"es\">ojalá</em>, and after conjunctions such as <em lang=\"es\">para que, antes de que, aunque</em>, and <em lang=\"es\">cuando</em> about the future.",
